"speaker": "⛩️ Kamikitakuni Shrine",
"text": "A sacred mist flows from the Torii gate. The spiritual bell chimes warmly in your heart."
}, {
"speaker": "Ookami Mio",
"text": "Spirits of the land, please watch over us and purify the darkened hearts of our friends."
}, {
"speaker": "✨ Divine Blessing",
"text": "Your HP and Mana are fully restored! (+100 Shrine Coins received)"
}]
