"speaker": "Ancient Stone Monument",
"text": "\"Beyond the southern boundary of Route 1 Forest stands the Haunted Dojo Gym.\""
}, {
"speaker": "Ancient Stone Monument",
"text": "\"An Oni swordswoman dwells there, gripped by fiery stigmata. Defeating her will purify her soul and welcome her into your party.\""
}]

